From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Viacheslav Bocharov <v@baodeep.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 15:55:12 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 507/508] dt-bindings: thermal: amlogic: add S7

The S7 temperature sensor is the G12A design. As on T7, the secure
monitor reports its calibration, and the sensor takes a bus clock and a
functional clock.

Add the amlogic,s7-thermal compatible.

Signed-off-by: Viacheslav Bocharov <v@baodeep.com>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/thermal/amlogic,thermal.yaml         | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/thermal/amlogic,thermal.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/thermal/amlogic,thermal.yaml
index e72cb39ac635..43dda3978e2a 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/thermal/amlogic,thermal.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/thermal/amlogic,thermal.yaml
@@ -23,6 +23,7 @@ properties:
           - const: amlogic,g12a-thermal
       - enum:
           - amlogic,a1-cpu-thermal
+          - amlogic,s7-thermal
           - amlogic,t7-thermal
 
   reg:
@@ -84,7 +85,9 @@ allOf:
       properties:
         compatible:
           contains:
-            const: amlogic,t7-thermal
+            enum:
+              - amlogic,s7-thermal
+              - amlogic,t7-thermal
     then:
       properties:
         clocks:
